{"id":"a2416b6547fce789","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-rec-complexity.md","title":"Rec 的 Sigma3 完全性","display":"thm-rec-complexity — Rec 的 Sigma3 完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-rec-complexity","aliases":["20-thm-rec-complexity"],"display":"thm-rec-complexity — Rec 的 Sigma3 完全性","chapter":"4","section":"4.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Corollary 4.3.6；Theorem 4.3.5","source_pdf_pages":[124,125],"source_printed_pages":[88,89],"depends_on":["[[20-df-rec-index]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]","[[20-thm-cof-complete-pair]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-rec-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-rec-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rec-complexity — Rec 的 Sigma3 完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 4.3.6；Theorem 4.3.5"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88</span><span>89</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"481242259f6605e4\" href=\"?note=481242259f6605e4\" title=\"20-df-rec-index\">20-df-rec-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eedfed81ed59c040\" href=\"?note=eedfed81ed59c040\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complete-pair\">20-thm-cof-complete-pair</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 采用标准编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"481242259f6605e4\" href=\"?note=481242259f6605e4\" title=\"20-df-rec-index\">20-df-rec-index</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"eedfed81ed59c040\" href=\"?note=eedfed81ed59c040\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complete-pair\">20-thm-cof-complete-pair</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rec\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Rec},\\Sigma^0_3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rec\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Rec},\\Sigma^0_3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上界使用补集枚举判定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 可计算当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_j\">\\(W_j\\)</span> 是其补集；等价于</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j\\ \\forall x,t\\ \\exists s\\ [\\neg(x\\in W_{e,t}\\land x\\in W_{j,t})\\land(x\\in W_{e,s}\\lor x\\in W_{j,s})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j\\ \\forall x,t\\ \\exists s\\ [\\neg(x\\in W_{e,t}\\land x\\in W_{j,t})\\land(x\\in W_{e,s}\\lor x\\in W_{j,s})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一项确保两集合不交，第二项确保覆盖所有自然数；阶段集有限可判定，配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,t)\">\\((x,t)\\)</span> 后为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_3\">\\(\\Sigma_3\\)</span> 形式。</p>\n<p>困难性对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\Sigma_3\">\\(P\\in\\Sigma_3\\)</span> 使用上一原子的同一单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>：肯定情形域余有限，故属于 Rec；否定情形域与 K 同度，故不属于 Rec。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\le_1\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(P\\le_1\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>，得到完全性。原书 4.3.6 的类型是 Corollary，前面的实质构造为 Theorem 4.3.5，来源已分别列明。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 88–89 / PDF 124–125。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-rec-index","status":"resolved","id":"481242259f6605e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-rec-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved",